/Title (Sharing Request Timelines To establish eligibility, related medical expenses must accumulate to the Member Responsibility Amount \(MRA\) within six months of the initial date of service. Once the MRA has been met, the Sharing Request remains open for the duration of the medical event, provided there is no six-month consecutive gap in related treatment or expenses. If a six-month gap occurs between related services, the Sharing Request automatically closes. Any subsequent treatment will require submission of a new Sharing Request and satisfaction of a new MRA.)
